1
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,250
The medicine...

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:20,630
It's done.

3
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:24,670
Ellen...

4
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:30,750
You're burning up!

5
00:00:32,750 --> 00:00:34,960
To think you pushed yourself to this point...

6
00:00:45,830 --> 00:00:48,710
I can't believe she managed
to make this kind of medicine.

7
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:51,960
It's worse than I thought.

8
00:00:52,710 --> 00:00:56,170
Ellen's strength and growth
are out of balance.

9
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:57,460
Huh?

10
00:00:57,540 --> 00:01:02,330
If I'm being honest,
we should have anticipated this...

11
00:01:02,710 --> 00:01:06,000
But you would have stopped her
if you'd known, wouldn't you?

12
00:01:07,210 --> 00:01:08,960
What do you mean by that?

13
00:01:09,250 --> 00:01:12,960
I wanted to know Ellen's limits.

14
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:16,040
I'm sorry for not telling you.

15
00:01:22,710 --> 00:01:24,750
I must discuss matters with my older sisters.

16
00:01:29,380 --> 00:01:32,960
Was Ori testing Ellen?

17
00:03:05,130 --> 00:03:09,080
MELANCHOLY OF RAFILIA

18
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:13,420
Miss Ellen.

19
00:03:13,830 --> 00:03:15,330
We need to talk.

20
00:03:15,710 --> 00:03:16,750
Yes, sir...

21
00:03:18,170 --> 00:03:21,500
Not eating, not sleeping,
and holing up in your room!

22
00:03:21,580 --> 00:03:23,790
You had everyone fretting!

23
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:31,790
Gosh, I was so worried about you that
I thought I was going to lose it!

24
00:03:32,330 --> 00:03:36,790
- Lose it, I tell you!
- That's, uh... I'm sorry.

25
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:39,250
From now on, no more
pushing yourself like that!

26
00:03:39,580 --> 00:03:43,750
If you do, I'll never take you
to the Vankreift mansion ever again!

27
00:03:43,830 --> 00:03:45,170
What?!

28
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:54,790
Ellen, you don't understand
just how worried I was, do you?

29
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:56,170
Father?

30
00:04:02,250 --> 00:04:05,040
Oh, Rovel. This was really
hard on you, wasn't it?

31
00:04:05,130 --> 00:04:06,630
Mother...

32
00:04:06,710 --> 00:04:11,460
Next time you use your powers,
don't lock yourself away, okay?

33
00:04:11,540 --> 00:04:13,830
Do it where we can keep an eye on you.

34
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:16,290
Huh? How come?

35
00:04:16,790 --> 00:04:21,540
Your father's so beside himself
because he couldn't keep you from collapsing.

36
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:24,250
Father...

37
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:29,290
You haven't yet mastered
control of your powers.

38
00:04:29,380 --> 00:04:31,670
You still need to practice a bit more, okay?

39
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:33,670
Y-Yes, ma'am...

40
00:04:34,630 --> 00:04:38,170
That said, I am impressed you were
able to make something like this.

41
00:04:38,750 --> 00:04:40,670
That's my girl.

42
00:04:42,710 --> 00:04:43,750
Thank you!

43
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:47,630
Ellen doesn't care to fully
understand my feelings...

44
00:04:48,750 --> 00:04:52,540
If anything could stop
my beating heart, it's Ellen.

45
00:04:53,330 --> 00:04:54,750
I would never!

46
00:04:54,830 --> 00:04:59,580
You totally would! Ellen, you dummy!

47
00:05:02,790 --> 00:05:04,210
Dummy, dummy, dummy!
I was really worried, you know?!

48
00:05:04,290 --> 00:05:09,000
As an apology, let Rovel hug
you all day today, okay?

49
00:05:15,330 --> 00:05:16,790
The medicine is done?

50
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:21,750
Yes. With this, I can fulfill the promise
I made to everyone at the mine.

51
00:05:21,830 --> 00:05:25,960
Is that right? Ellen, you truly are amazing.

52
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:30,130
Isn't she? Our little Ellen is incredible.

53
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:35,380
Now, the next thing I need to do is...

54
00:05:35,460 --> 00:05:37,960
Huh? There's more?

55
00:05:38,330 --> 00:05:39,380
Yes.

56
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:47,500
<i>After that, Father, Uncle, and I made</i>
<i>frequent visits to the mine together.</i>

57
00:05:48,750 --> 00:05:51,710
Gold and diamonds...

58
00:05:51,790 --> 00:05:53,420
And silver too!

59
00:05:56,170 --> 00:06:00,960
<i>I made it seem like the minerals</i>
<i>had always been there. </i>

60
00:06:12,170 --> 00:06:14,750
We were able to reopen thanks to Ellen.

61
00:06:15,330 --> 00:06:16,540
Yeah.

62
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:26,250
<i>Then, as promised, I began the</i>
<i>pneumoconiosis treatment for everyone.</i>

63
00:06:26,830 --> 00:06:31,750
<i>Furthermore, I produced painkillers,</i>
<i>antibiotics, cold medicines,</i>

64
00:06:31,830 --> 00:06:38,080
<i>and allergy medications for them all</i>
<i>to ensure their good health.</i>

65
00:06:38,170 --> 00:06:43,380
Seeing the miners so full of vim
and vigor lifts my spirits as well.

66
00:06:43,460 --> 00:06:46,130
Truly, nothing beats being healthy!

67
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:51,580
Concerning that, Father, Uncle, I would
like to discuss something with both of you.

68
00:06:55,630 --> 00:06:59,580
Now then, Ellen, what have
you come up with this time?

69
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:03,830
I heard the church in town
is also used as a treatment center.

70
00:07:04,250 --> 00:07:08,920
I was thinking I'd like them to manage
the medicine I produce.

71
00:07:09,250 --> 00:07:11,500
You'd leave your medicines
in someone else's hands?

72
00:07:11,790 --> 00:07:13,790
Eventually, anyway.

73
00:07:15,670 --> 00:07:17,960
Brother, what do you think?

74
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:22,290
Well, as long as it doesn't
become a burden for Ellen...

75
00:07:22,630 --> 00:07:24,040
It'll be fine.

76
00:07:24,130 --> 00:07:29,210
I'm never going to do anything
to worry you ever again, Father!

77
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:34,170
I see. Then it's fine.

78
00:07:34,790 --> 00:07:37,250
Thank you so much, Father!

79
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,960
I'll get that arranged for you right away.

80
00:07:40,710 --> 00:07:42,500
Please do, Uncle.

81
00:07:42,580 --> 00:07:43,630
All right.

82
00:07:57,580 --> 00:07:58,750
What is the matter?

83
00:08:00,540 --> 00:08:02,790
Listen carefully, Lady Rafilia.

84
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:04,540
I've told you many times, haven't I?

85
00:08:04,630 --> 00:08:08,040
These are very important rules that
a noblewoman must follow.

86
00:08:08,130 --> 00:08:10,040
You must learn them properly andâ€”

87
00:08:10,170 --> 00:08:12,250
I've had enough already!

88
00:08:12,670 --> 00:08:15,880
Day after day, all I do is study!
And I'm sick of it!

89
00:08:15,960 --> 00:08:19,880
I didn't come here to be a noblewoman!

90
00:08:19,960 --> 00:08:20,960
Lady Rafilia?

91
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:23,250
Wait! Wherever are you going?

92
00:08:23,500 --> 00:08:24,750
Just leave me alone!

93
00:08:25,580 --> 00:08:28,330
You mustn't run! It's improper!

94
00:08:28,580 --> 00:08:30,670
<i>Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!</i>

95
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:53,750
Going to live with Father
is like a dream come true!

96
00:08:54,460 --> 00:08:55,670
Yes, it is.

97
00:09:02,170 --> 00:09:05,170
You won't have to work
anymore, right, Mother?

98
00:09:05,250 --> 00:09:06,790
That's right.

99
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:09,670
Then we can be together all the time!

100
00:09:09,750 --> 00:09:11,330
I can't wait!

101
00:09:22,670 --> 00:09:26,500
Wow! It's like a castle!

102
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:03,210
My, how uncouth! Get down here this instant!

103
00:10:04,250 --> 00:10:07,790
You are a member of the Vankreift family.

104
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:12,170
You must learn to become
a proper lady worthy of the name.

105
00:10:12,670 --> 00:10:17,170
If you do not conduct yourself accordingly,
you will cause problems for the duke.

106
00:10:19,130 --> 00:10:21,330
<i>This isn't what I imagined.</i>

107
00:10:21,830 --> 00:10:25,880
<i>It wasn't supposed to be this way. And...</i>

108
00:10:30,290 --> 00:10:33,880
I want to see the prince.

109
00:10:34,330 --> 00:10:35,380
Rafilia.

110
00:10:36,420 --> 00:10:40,710
The next time I come by,
I'll be sure to bring you something.

111
00:10:43,710 --> 00:10:46,330
I wish he'd come already.

112
00:10:50,670 --> 00:10:53,960
Oh, that's right! The other day, Lady Ellen...

113
00:10:54,710 --> 00:10:57,580
Hey! Just what is Ellen's deal, anyway?

114
00:10:57,670 --> 00:10:59,880
Oh, please, don't mind us.

115
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:02,580
If you'll excuse us, Lady Rafilia...

116
00:11:04,380 --> 00:11:06,500
<i>Everyone keeps going</i>
<i>on and on about Ellen!</i>

117
00:11:06,580 --> 00:11:08,790
<i>Just what exactly </i>is<i> she?</i>

118
00:11:12,830 --> 00:11:14,290
Father!

119
00:11:14,790 --> 00:11:17,880
Rafilia? I'm always telling you, aren't I?

120
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:20,540
A lady shouldn't be running like that.

121
00:11:20,630 --> 00:11:23,170
Oh, I'm so sick of hearing that!

122
00:11:23,250 --> 00:11:25,250
I came here to ask you something!

123
00:11:25,750 --> 00:11:27,580
Sorry, but I'm busy at the moment.

124
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:30,790
Please go ask your mother.

125
00:11:32,130 --> 00:11:35,170
Why are you always like this?!
I can't believe you!

126
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:39,130
Sauvel.

127
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:43,830
Don't you think your daughter
had something important to talk about?

128
00:11:44,540 --> 00:11:45,580
Huh?

129
00:11:46,040 --> 00:11:49,500
If you're her father, hear her out.

130
00:11:52,170 --> 00:11:55,170
I hang on every word my daughter has to say!

131
00:11:55,250 --> 00:11:58,290
Almost to the point of annoying her, you know?

132
00:12:05,750 --> 00:12:06,920
Mother!

133
00:12:07,420 --> 00:12:09,960
Lady Rafilia, whatever is the matter?

134
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:11,380
Listen to this, Mother!

135
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:14,330
Rafilia... What is it?

136
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:16,880
Father is being horrible!

137
00:12:16,960 --> 00:12:18,380
Just shut up already.

138
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:19,920
Mother...

139
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:23,710
I'm not feeling well. Can't you tell?

140
00:12:23,790 --> 00:12:26,790
Milady, you've simply had too much to drink.

141
00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:29,500
You have something to say?

142
00:12:30,250 --> 00:12:32,330
I overstepped, my lady.

143
00:12:32,420 --> 00:12:35,330
My apologies. Here's some water.

144
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,080
Mother?

145
00:12:37,170 --> 00:12:39,420
Didn't I just tell you I wasn't feeling well?!

146
00:12:39,500 --> 00:12:41,580
Get out of here already!

147
00:12:47,290 --> 00:12:49,500
Are you all right, milady?

148
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:53,170
Huh? Y-Yeah...

149
00:12:57,580 --> 00:12:59,710
This is dangerous, so I'll be taking it away.

150
00:12:59,790 --> 00:13:01,290
Hey, wait a minute!

151
00:13:01,830 --> 00:13:03,830
You leave that here!

152
00:13:06,920 --> 00:13:09,000
Are you all right, Mother?!

153
00:13:10,750 --> 00:13:11,960
You're still here?

154
00:13:13,250 --> 00:13:14,960
I came because I wanted to talk.

155
00:13:15,290 --> 00:13:18,500
Father won't listen to me at all!

156
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:22,790
He's busy. There's nothing
you or I can do about that.

157
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:25,170
Even if he's busy, I still...

158
00:13:25,670 --> 00:13:28,040
Then will you listen to me, Mother?!

159
00:13:30,210 --> 00:13:31,250
Huh?

160
00:13:31,330 --> 00:13:35,420
Day in and day out, all I do is study.
I'm so sick of it!

161
00:13:35,790 --> 00:13:39,500
The tutor tells me if I don't do it properly,
I'll bring shame to the family!

162
00:13:39,580 --> 00:13:42,250
All day long, it's nobility this, nobility that!

163
00:13:43,290 --> 00:13:44,500
Yeah, you're right.

164
00:13:45,670 --> 00:13:48,750
They look down on us because we're commoners.

165
00:13:48,830 --> 00:13:49,880
Huh?

166
00:13:50,540 --> 00:13:54,040
Why must I be treated this way?

167
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:59,750
Why am I still excluded
when I'm part of the upper class now?!

168
00:14:02,380 --> 00:14:03,580
Mother!

169
00:14:04,380 --> 00:14:05,630
I'm coming in.

170
00:14:10,170 --> 00:14:12,420
I could hear you from the hallway.

171
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:20,250
Rafilia.

172
00:14:22,040 --> 00:14:23,330
Rafilia!

173
00:14:38,330 --> 00:14:40,380
Regarding the fertilizer for the fields,

174
00:14:40,460 --> 00:14:43,130
I would like to ask Lady Ellen's
opinion on the matter.

175
00:14:43,210 --> 00:14:45,830
All right. I'll relay the message.

176
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:52,040
Roren, please leave us.

177
00:14:52,130 --> 00:14:53,170
As you wish.

178
00:14:54,790 --> 00:14:56,040
Mother?

179
00:14:58,500 --> 00:15:00,630
Sauvel, what is going on?

180
00:15:00,710 --> 00:15:02,830
Huh? With what?

181
00:15:02,920 --> 00:15:04,750
I'm talking about Aria.

182
00:15:07,290 --> 00:15:09,420
I would like to know myself.

183
00:15:10,210 --> 00:15:12,380
Do you plan on leaving things
the way they are?

184
00:15:17,790 --> 00:15:20,290
Please think about Rafilia as well.

185
00:15:21,380 --> 00:15:23,040
I know.

186
00:15:24,920 --> 00:15:29,500
That girl views everyone in the house
besides her mother as an enemy.

187
00:15:30,080 --> 00:15:34,540
She's even rebelling against
her education as a noble.

188
00:15:37,460 --> 00:15:41,630
I don't know how to interact with her.

189
00:15:42,330 --> 00:15:47,210
I had to live apart from her
for years after she was born.

190
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:49,330
That's part of it.

191
00:15:49,880 --> 00:15:51,080
Sauvel...

192
00:15:53,130 --> 00:15:55,670
I've decided to enroll Rafilia
in an academy.

193
00:15:55,750 --> 00:15:56,790
What?

194
00:15:57,250 --> 00:16:00,040
It may be best that she
doesn't stay in this house.

195
00:16:01,130 --> 00:16:05,500
If she can be around other noble children,
perhaps she will get the hang of things.

196
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:08,290
You're right.

197
00:16:08,380 --> 00:16:13,170
Yes, that may be what's best
for her at the moment.

198
00:16:14,210 --> 00:16:19,330
Mother, why is Rafilia so rebellious?

199
00:16:22,290 --> 00:16:26,630
Ellen is so cooperative.
Why can't Rafilia...?

200
00:16:27,580 --> 00:16:29,540
Are you really asking that?

201
00:16:31,670 --> 00:16:34,630
Stop comparing Ellen and Rafilia at once.

202
00:16:35,830 --> 00:16:39,250
They are each their own person.

203
00:16:45,710 --> 00:16:49,540
Rafilia needs someone who will listen to her.

204
00:16:50,210 --> 00:16:55,460
However, the only person she trusts,
her mother, is in a right state.

205
00:16:55,540 --> 00:16:57,170
She can't be relied upon.

206
00:16:57,750 --> 00:17:01,630
That's why I tried to fill her shoes, but...

207
00:17:01,710 --> 00:17:05,630
It seems Rafilia dislikes me greatly.

208
00:17:07,540 --> 00:17:11,790
It doesn't matter what anyone says
to Aria and Rafilia. Nothing works.

209
00:17:12,130 --> 00:17:15,080
It won't unless they themselves
wish to change.

210
00:17:16,540 --> 00:17:18,920
Now then, I'll be going.

211
00:17:24,380 --> 00:17:26,460
We're done talking now.

212
00:17:26,540 --> 00:17:27,580
Yes, my lady.

213
00:17:32,710 --> 00:17:39,250
<i>Sauvel... I want you to realize</i>
<i>that for yourself as well.</i>

214
00:17:50,580 --> 00:17:54,330
Please take the day off work
tomorrow and rest up.

215
00:17:54,420 --> 00:17:58,500
Also, please take this medicine
in the morning and at night, okay?

216
00:17:59,080 --> 00:18:03,170
All right. Thank you very much,
Healing Princess.

217
00:18:03,250 --> 00:18:04,330
Huh?

218
00:18:04,580 --> 00:18:08,710
Oh, everyone is calling you that,
so I couldn't resist.

219
00:18:09,460 --> 00:18:10,790
What?

220
00:18:21,750 --> 00:18:23,630
Good work today, Ellen.

221
00:18:24,460 --> 00:18:25,960
Are you tired?

222
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:28,040
No, I'm fine.

223
00:18:28,790 --> 00:18:31,040
That was the last patient of the day.

224
00:18:31,500 --> 00:18:32,790
Thank you very much.

225
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:35,500
We're the ones who should be thanking you.

226
00:18:35,830 --> 00:18:41,960
Even so, Uncle, it was very helpful for you
to decide in advance who needed treatment.

227
00:18:42,500 --> 00:18:48,130
My brother here <i>did</i> strictly say I should
make this as easy for you as possible.

228
00:18:48,210 --> 00:18:49,880
Of course I did.

229
00:18:50,540 --> 00:18:52,630
Oh... That's right, Ellen.

230
00:18:52,960 --> 00:18:57,920
Regarding the town's treatment center,
preparations are progressing smoothly.

231
00:18:59,130 --> 00:19:00,380
Really?!

232
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:04,080
You're wonderful, Uncle! You work so fast!

233
00:19:04,540 --> 00:19:08,960
Ah, yes, and about the fields...
Roren wishes to discuss them with you.

234
00:19:09,040 --> 00:19:10,880
It's about the fertilizer, right?

235
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:16,040
When I last spoke to Pawpaw,
he told me you have land in the backyard.

236
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:18,540
If you can advise him on it, by all means.

237
00:19:18,630 --> 00:19:19,750
Certainly!

238
00:19:19,830 --> 00:19:22,290
My little girl is wonderful!

239
00:19:22,540 --> 00:19:25,250
B-Brother, you're smothering her!

240
00:19:34,330 --> 00:19:38,130
Ellen! I could put you
on my shoulder too, you know!

241
00:19:38,420 --> 00:19:42,710
No need. You're shorter than Uncle, anyway.

242
00:19:42,790 --> 00:19:44,540
Shock!

243
00:19:53,040 --> 00:19:54,130
Ori?

244
00:19:54,580 --> 00:19:56,040
What's this all of a sudden?

245
00:19:56,130 --> 00:19:57,290
Mother?

246
00:19:57,630 --> 00:19:59,630
I was just thinking...

247
00:19:59,710 --> 00:20:04,500
I really want to work with you guys too!

248
00:20:05,830 --> 00:20:06,880
Huh?

249
00:20:07,170 --> 00:20:08,830
Mother, you can't do that!

250
00:20:08,920 --> 00:20:13,630
Oh, that's not fair! Not fair at all!
Ellen, you meaniehead!

251
00:20:13,710 --> 00:20:17,080
Huh, what? What's a "meaniehead"?

252
00:20:17,170 --> 00:20:19,920
It refers to someone
who is unkind and such.

253
00:20:21,380 --> 00:20:23,330
That's not the point!

254
00:20:23,670 --> 00:20:25,670
Where'd you learn that word?

255
00:20:25,750 --> 00:20:28,670
I'll have you know your mother
is studying hard too!

256
00:20:28,750 --> 00:20:30,540
Now, now, calm down.

257
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:35,130
Well, I was worried, so I've
been watching over you guys.

258
00:20:35,210 --> 00:20:37,960
You all seemed to be having so much fun...

259
00:20:38,040 --> 00:20:40,170
I wanted to join in too!

260
00:20:40,250 --> 00:20:43,080
Mother, this is my job.

261
00:20:43,170 --> 00:20:47,210
Besides, if you're here, you'll have
a massive impact on everything around.

262
00:20:47,670 --> 00:20:51,920
And what about your important job
of supporting this world?

263
00:20:52,250 --> 00:20:58,460
No! I don't wanna be the only
one left out! No, no, no!

264
00:20:58,540 --> 00:20:59,580
Ori.

265
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:03,080
Come here.

266
00:21:08,960 --> 00:21:15,210
Uncle, right now, Father and I are going
to spoil Mother to her heart's content,

267
00:21:15,670 --> 00:21:17,420
so I'll be heading home for today.

268
00:21:19,420 --> 00:21:20,500
I see.

269
00:21:24,250 --> 00:21:26,040
Thank you very much!

270
00:21:29,830 --> 00:21:30,920
Later!

271
00:21:39,040 --> 00:21:41,420
Oh, I'm so sick of hearing that!

272
00:21:41,500 --> 00:21:43,540
I came here to ask you something!

273
00:21:44,380 --> 00:21:46,170
Sorry, but I'm busy at the moment.

274
00:21:46,670 --> 00:21:49,500
Please go ask your mother.

275
00:21:50,750 --> 00:21:52,750
<i>Why are you always like this?!</i>

276
00:21:55,630 --> 00:21:56,960
Rafilia...

277
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:00,960
Father!

278
00:22:01,750 --> 00:22:02,750
Rafilia.

